  (text "Block 7: USB-C data, power button, LEDs, boot control\n\n- USB 2.0 data from USB-C to CM5 (for flashing / rpiboot)\n- nRPIBOOT switch or pad for USB boot mode\n- PWR_BUT momentary button\n- LED_nPWR / LED_nACT status LEDs\n- PMIC_ENABLE, EEPROM_nWP handling per datasheet: UNVERIFIED\n\nBlock 8 (optional, if space): speaker/haptic footprint, expansion header" (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid cf659b8f-b35b-4441-be7c-bc739268f02c))
  (text "Source rule: every CM5 connection on this sheet must cite RP-008180-DS (CM5 datasheet),\nRP-008182-DS / CM5IO KiCad files, or the Pi 5 schematics. None have been read yet." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid ece6f73c-a5f1-4949-8239-2646cb086a47))
